OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer's arm broken stopping
OL,4,Amotorbike theft suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn officer broke his arm tackling a
OL,7,Fsuspected thief who tried to run away
OL,8,Fafter struggling to ride a stolen
OL,9,Fmotorbike, police said.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Police said it was called to
OL,12,Freports of a Suzuki 1250 Bandit
OL,13,Fmotorbike being stolen from the Royal
OL,14,FDerby Hospital's bike shed just after
OL,15,F20:00 BST on Monday.
OL,17,FOn the way there, officers spotted the
OL,18,Fvehicle and a second stolen motorcycle
OL,19,F- a BMW - and began pursuit, but the
OL,20,Fsuspect on the Suzuki was struggling to
OL,21,Fride it and tried to flee on foot, the
OL,22,Fforce said.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
